---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';

import DifferentialCryptanalysisLogo from '../assets/images/logos/DifferentialCryptanalysisLogo.svg';
import ProjectHeader from './ProjectHeader.astro';
---
<div>
  <ProjectHeader title="Differential Cryptanalysis" subtitle="Master’s project" logo={DifferentialCryptanalysisLogo} custommargin="5px" />
  <p>
    Differential cryptanalysis is a subtle, beautiful, and powerful method of breaking some of the world’s strongest ciphers.
    Unfortunately, the resources for education about this technique are sparse. Ones that do exist are very difficult to understand, especially for beginners to cryptography.
    The purpose behind this tutorial, my Master’s project, is to introduce this amazing tecnique to beginners through an interactive, self-contained webpage which makes no assumptions about prior knowledge.
  </p>
</div>